flowchart TD
    A[Request received] --> B[Governance completeness review]
    B --> C[System owner approval]
    C --> D[Legal / DPO review where needed]
    D --> E{All required approvals?}
    E -- No --> F[Pending or rejected; no start]
    E -- Yes --> G[Issue Engagement ID and freeze RoE]
    G --> H[Assessment within approved boundary]
    H --> I[Finding report]
    I --> J{Personal data or credentials involved?}
    J -- Yes / Unknown --> K[Private handling and DPO / security escalation]
    J -- No --> L[Coordinated disclosure to verified owner]
    K --> M[Remediation tracking]
    L --> M
    M --> N[Authorized verification and closure]
